Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暗影游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮换！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮换！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮换！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到我的指令吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not hear my instruction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 Doctore\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意去吓胆小鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not mean to scare the rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了准备行政官主办的竞技赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The games of the magistrate approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要认真听清我的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully to my instruction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个被选上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every man chosen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要在竞技场力保获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will see victory in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许保证不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not every man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把水留给那些值得喝的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the water for men who deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,下雨吧！该死的神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain! By jupiter's cock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧下雨吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you fucking rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒像在渎神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaspheming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.74,0:01:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,人要是不爽 这两者也就一线之隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two are narrowly separated in these trying times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不止一线哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the gap widens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有更多债主 想要逼债？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More creditors, seeking action?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能看了会让人开心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something of more cheerful note, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚收到的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently delivered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius行政官寄来的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}From magistrate calavius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要亲自来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is coming here to personally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为比赛选人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Select men for his games!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了抚慰天神 结束干旱的比赛啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games to appease the gods and end the drought!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是继Theokoles打败100名角斗士的比赛之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biggest games since theokoles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大型的赛事了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bested 100 men in the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他干嘛亲自来？除非…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why come himself? Unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,终极勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thprimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.31,0:02:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能在这种大赛中稳操胜券…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were to secure the main event at these games…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He arrives within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们所有的水聚集起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gather all the water we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus 你的袍子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus, your robe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫医生来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should talk to the magistrate about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人想杀你 想杀掉像你这么正直的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men tried to kill you, an honest man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,事发于那种不光彩的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a dishonest place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去说 我们不该让行政官在这种琐事上分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we won't concern the magistrate with these things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和终极勇士一事相比 简直不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with the primus in the balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我自己会解决的 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tend to the matter myself, um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个意图刺杀Batiatus的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the mark of one of the slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶身上的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who tried to kill batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过这种烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark is unknown to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者要靠近点看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps a closer look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手艺的细节部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details of such craftsmanship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一瞥可不够啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should not be viewed in haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能见过一个类似的烙印…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have seen a similar mark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你觉得怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是人靠衣装啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You adorn them like a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我脱了它们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be out of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你来场鱼水之欢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deep into you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calavius行政官到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate calavius arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的财神爷到了 就像你这条鱼一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fortunes rise, like your cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你这滩水就继续淌着吧 回头我们欢个够… 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay wet and we'll make it rain presently…Ohhh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真是让我们蓬荜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do us honor with your…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,生辉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus 你好！我正跟Solonius聊到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good batiatus! I was telling solonius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么认识你父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I knew your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是个真正的罗马勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there was a true roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可真伟大 他人难以望其项背\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great man, none of his like to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会像我父亲那样 满足您的一切需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will attempt to fill your needs as he would have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To business then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知 干旱已使整座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you well know, the drought has parched the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,濒临崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the point of madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用尽一切办法 也没法使上天降雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tried everything to tempted the skies into tears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直快成「大灾难」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even to the point of hecatombe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭了一百头牛 却连一滴雨都没求到\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred cattle sacrificed, and yet not a drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为天神不稀罕牛血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the gods do not want the blood of cattle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要人血！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want the blood of men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good solonius has been kind enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮忙筹办了这场赛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lend a hand in organizing games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来满足天神\N{\fnArial\fs30}To appease their appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一场终极决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be sine missione.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要拼个你死我活 方才罢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No draw. No mercy shown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有最好的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the finest gladiators{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be invited to participate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus家族也只会 提供最好的角斗士参赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the finest are offered in the house of batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 看看我的勇士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, examine my wares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人印象深刻的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}An impressive selection, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Solonius亲自挑的人 有得一拼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rivaling that of good solonius himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有终极勇士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I have the primus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的对手还空着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your opponent still to be chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要满足天神\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to appease the gods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得从那沙地上挑出一位来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have one upon the sands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 卡普亚的战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus the champion of capua, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意和Solonius选出的任意勇士一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will willing fight anyone that solonius has to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是传奇人物之间的竞技！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will truly be a contest between legends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,传奇人物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我未曾向你提及吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did I fail to mention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius已派出Theokoles 作为终极勇士压阵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good solonius has secured theokoles for the primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}theokoles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了把他哄来卡普亚城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to coax him to our fair city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可花了不少钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}At great expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此这般进贡祈求 若神明仍未赐雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the gods fail to grant us rain with such a tribute, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,必是我们遭到天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are surely cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕触怒神明呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the gods will be displeased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场较量 对比悬殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The match is unbalanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前与Theokoles竞技的角斗士中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one man theokoles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅有一人得以存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是Crixus和斯巴达克斯携手出战 又将如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if crixus were joined by your man spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早就该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His death was fated in execution, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他却逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he refuse to own it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他对战 使我连损四将\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cost me four men in his defiance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不知你债台高筑 Batiatus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your debts are well known, batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他们战死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you lose the men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚到的钱也足以使你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purse is enough to hold off your creditors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂且拖欠债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 除非你宁愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless of course you would rather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不参赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit out these games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或另派他人参赛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or any others that follow, which…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我决定派他们出赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I will set my men to the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的勇士们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My titans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍停片刻 听听令人倍感荣耀的消息！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pause, and hear glorious news!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官Titus Calavius 已邀请我们实力最强的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate titus calavius has invited our best men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为终极勇士出战！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight in his primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,出列！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！出列！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus! Step forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已被选定携手迎战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been chosen to fight as one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之影 Theokoles！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against theokoles, the shadow of death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！喔！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Ow! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:06:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！我靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！喔！妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！喔！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Ow! Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你们会成为一对完美搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you two will make a fine couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不愿与他一起出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather fight without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是一起去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And die the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}This theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕是徒有虚名吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legends can't be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场上 他身经百战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's en cut a thousand times in the arena, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,却未尝败绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是乖乖待在竞技赌场的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you would have been safer in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们若是赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were to win, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赚多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How large would be the purse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以在叙利亚讨十个老婆了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Large enough to wrest ten wives from the syrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是让他们去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You send them to certain death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我代替他们出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me fight in their stead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个建议不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an excellent suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠Theokoles一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe theokoles a debt of pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无需这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were not requested!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊 没人会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no one has forgotten how bravely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:07:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对战Theokoles时的英勇表现 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fought against theokoles, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我并未获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet without victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在与Theokoles的竞技中 你是唯一存活下来的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand the only man to face him in the arena and live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本身就是一种胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}That in itself is a victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安心完成好你的训练任务吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your purpose to the task of training{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让Crixus和斯巴达克斯共同出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus and spartacus for the match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怕是无法逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear no amount will save them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles的死亡之影了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the shadow's grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他们准备 为荣耀而死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then prepare them for a glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个牌子是Remus的 一个在城北\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brand belonged to remus, a slave trader{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行交易的奴隶商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plying wares north of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus？怕是无名之辈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remus? The name holds no recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor to I. Yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要购买一个奴隶 来做见不得人的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were to purchase a slave, intent on foul designs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定要从卡普亚城外买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it would be from outside capua, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免轻易就被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}To avoid simple discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到Remus 带他来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find remus and bring him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助你训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help with your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要理由吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need there be one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该那样看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't look at me in that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经竭尽全力 不这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try with all my strength not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}sleep, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And regain your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意和你争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek no quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现在这里 就是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence here would state otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确实有分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had our differences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own my part in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们想要击败Theokoles…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet if we are to defeat theokoles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场上 不会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no such thing in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为 你能杀掉那巨人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe you can slay the giant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭你自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我往常那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I always stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time you do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles倒下后 荣耀全是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When theokoles falls, the glory will be mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不能一致对外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we do not come to common ground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death shared will be ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 似乎他们有机会战胜Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. As if they stand chance against theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 或许天神会眷顾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um. Perhaps the gods will favor them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 或许我也可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and perhaps I should sprout wings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长翅膀飞走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And flutter off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌注是1000比1 赌Theokoles赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds lay a thousand to one against them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没人打败过Crixus呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man has ever won betting against crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会下注赌他们会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would lay coin towards their victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fool's wager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happily received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一声不吭就要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave without words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None to give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你走出这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time you step beyond these walls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都会为你担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear for you and what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟软蛋似的 男人点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab hold of your cock and be a man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只做我必须做的 Pietros\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do what I must, pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我速去速回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll return soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the birds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pietros啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pietros!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请她来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She comes at my invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是那个被宠坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's not the time to be entertaining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小荡妇玩的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spoiled little bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官对她父亲Albinius言听计从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her father albinius holds the magistrate's ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她父亲说点好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were to place a word in it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus可能就会成为终极勇士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then crixus may be replaced in the primus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就算花上一千 也不会有什么结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could place a thousand and to no result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solonius在耍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius maneuvered you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有行政官相助！\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the aid of the magistrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果拒绝的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refuse and we would quickly find ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快会被 排除在竞技场之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excluded from the arena altogether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果Crixus失败了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if crixus falls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会成为我们的战神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will be our champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus家族还有哪个能赢得民众的呼声？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will the crowds clamor to see from the house of batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我是斯巴达克斯 竞技赌场的那个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not spartacus, that thing from the pits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你客人到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guest arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟她谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not broach the subject with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ilithyia啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,您莅临至此 我们荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do us honor with your presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有水喝 我才不在乎这些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would trade honor for water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 热气灌满了喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the heat is a thing living, crawling down the throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 让我们先解解渴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let us quench that thirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去处理比赛的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must to tend to business of the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩慢慢聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave you in loving hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true, then? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus和斯巴达克斯对战死亡之影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus and spartacus face the shadow of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天肯定会鲜血四溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood will surely flow on the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常希望色雷斯人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I long to see it pour from the thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个男人一样攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You attack as you would a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles没有肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theokoles is beyond flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有骨头和鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond blood and bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他主宰着生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the shadow that precedes death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让他独自进攻你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow him to fall upon you alone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now rise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,合二为一 攻击我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And come at me as one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give way, you fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The advantage was mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看Crixus是怎么攻击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How crixus moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他那身肌肉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way his muscles catch the sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的冠军 名副其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly the champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人能比\N{\fnArial\fs30}None to his equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们互相推搡 跟白痴一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jostle and trip over the other like fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要面对的是终极勇士Theokoles！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You face theokoles in the primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明自己的价值！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove yourselves worthy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要站近点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I crave a closer look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能下去看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go down among them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband would never allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏的训练场可不适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bowels of a ludus are no place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,议员的女儿呆啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a senator's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小屋里偷看 怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A private viewing then, in the villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会付钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would pay for it, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当帮朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A favor amongst friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得给我机会 还你人情啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must let me return it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直惦记着你的问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given thought to your problem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也找到了个解决的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have discovered solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,生孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过一个女人 朱诺女神的祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of a woman, a priestess of juno, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,向她祈福 可以多子多女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed with certain gifts of fertility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多尊贵的女人都谈到过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many prominent women speak of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如Servillia Cornelia Laelia…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Servillia, cornelia, laelia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius的妻子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius' wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 顺便提一下 她有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, in passing. She has a small boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她没去找那个祭司的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would have none, if not touched{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就没有孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the woman I speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮你引见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you let me arrange it for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算回报你的盛情吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a gift for your hospitality?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are friends, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢不了Doctore 我们怎么跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we to fare against theokoles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles较量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we cannot even best doctore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不碍手碍脚的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have bested him a dozen times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就打败他十几次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd not gotten underfoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 我和你在这场决斗里 是并肩作战的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take the sands beside you in this fight, crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别只因为你跟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you stand beside me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}With sword and shield, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把自己当成角斗士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not mistake yourself as a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为荣誉而战 而你为自由而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight to honor these walls, you fight to leave them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之所以战斗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为 你是个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我的处境为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept my place here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I embrace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然幻想着竞技场外的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still dream of a life beyond the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想着你那众所周知的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where that wife of yours we've all heard about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然依偎在你身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is still nestled by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的都是梦而已 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is all it is, spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天你会清醒地面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dream and one day soon you will awaken to the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都无法离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子即便还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your wife if she's not dead already, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也已经被罗马人侮辱成疯子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has been fucked to madness by a hundred roman cocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,整理下自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourselves cleaned up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人要召见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina requests your presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗 色雷斯人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am, thracian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Glaber副将一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With legatus glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.80,0:18:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 他出国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is regrettably abroad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能亲眼目睹 你跟Theokoles的生死对抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will not be able to theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们在床上缠绵的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall whisper of it to him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会悄悄地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replaying the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我的所见告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we are entwined in our bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.51,0:18:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和这个色雷斯人单独谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I require the thracian for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extend it by a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带到我那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champion of capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,能获您的观审 真是殊荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rare honor to receive a private audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最欣赏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I am most appreciative of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种场合他似乎穿多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does seem a touch overdressed for the occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的裤子 脱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your subligaria. Remove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的战神真是名不虚传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your champion is bold to his purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身体如此结实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His flesh is so hard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚如磐石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能有如许雕刻般的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that every man were carved so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好别让他待在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd best not keep him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他黎明就要开始训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His training resumes at first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他能打败死亡之影 活下来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he will survive, against the shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有神灵知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the gods know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,若这样的猛男都死了 那真是太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be pity to see such a man marred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许有阻止悲剧发生的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps there is a way to see such a tragedy averted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你父亲和行政官说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your father where to speak to the magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:21:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许… 怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps… To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将Crixus从这场比赛中换掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seeing crixus replaced in the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你所希望的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Theokoles一起进竞技场 你会怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you fear entering the arena with theokoles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期待已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I long for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所期待的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I long to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背井离乡 有幸存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You survived being dragged from your homeland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.57,0:21:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,得益于Glaber副将\N{\fnArial\fs30}By legatus glaber, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在竞技场打败了四名角斗士 逃过了死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You survived execution by four gladiators in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至逃过了竞技赌场的可怕较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even survived the horror of the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能逃过此劫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you survive this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Crixus战斗目的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus and I fight at cross-purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就找个合二为一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then find a way to unite them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have saved my life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的命在竞技场一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yours is yet worth little in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但把你和Crixus一起放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to loose crixus along with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对训练场来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be a blow from which this ludus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would not recover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎的只有我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My concern is only for my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她的命在于这些高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her fate is tied to these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,倘若它们垮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they collapse around me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自身难保 也救不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will be unable to help her from beneath the rubble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她安全前 我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not die until she is safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.61,0:22:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 证明出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, prove it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Crixus并肩作战 打败Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight as one with crixus, to best theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.70,0:22:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们都玩儿完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we are all fucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca回来了 满载而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca has returned, bearing gifts.{\r}
