Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死 你去死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking fuck, you fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius.{\r}
