Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,问个话有那么难？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was that so fucking hard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius的兄弟是行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius' cousin is the magistrate.{\r}
