Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你需要神的庇佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need the gods to descend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.80,0:24:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,助你一臂之力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fight by your side!{\r}
