Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.17,0:25:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我以为他很弱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His first cut…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并傻傻地进行攻击之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dealt when I thought him vulnerable.{\r}
