Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.87,0:29:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个 但是经常来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One. But frequently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么问题就不在男人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the difficulty lies not with the seed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在你的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But within the vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说 她生理上有问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean there's something wrong with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.34,0:29:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,神已经决定 拒绝给她天伦之乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have decided to withhold the joy of children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会恳求他们 重新考虑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will entreat them to reconsider…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.61,0:30:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱诺女神会保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juno has blessed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在一个小时之内完成结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must copulate within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.74,0:30:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.20,0:30:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生命之火熄灭前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the flame of life expires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.77,0:30:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good fortune be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.97,0:30:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only an hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她在开始之前会告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she would have told you that before she started, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.37,0:30:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想她的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering her price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.14,0:30:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感激你的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for arranging this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友之间无需客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unnecessary words from a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.51,0:30:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你的男人 我一定会让你完成这个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I being yours, I'll leave you to complete the ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.77,0:31:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使传说中的另一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although tales of this other man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.57,0:31:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是你最想要的 只要时间不是问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be most expected when time is not at issue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.51,0:31:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这该死的火把没有点燃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the fucking torches not lit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.64,0:31:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laelia啊…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laelia…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.34,0:31:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一笔债 Ovidius\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you a debt, ovidius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.37,0:31:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来还债的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to repay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.34,0:31:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.30,0:31:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy is unstained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.57,0:31:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何孩子 在你这种父亲的所作所为下 会是清白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No child is unstained by the deeds of his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remus派了2个奴隶 想要取走我的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two slaves, sent from remus to take my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你否认你给了钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny giving coin to the cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.04,0:32:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雇了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired the men, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是为了实现其他人的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to another's purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.10,0:32:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.17,0:32:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出他的名字 我向神起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak the name, and I swear to the gods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.37,0:32:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.57,0:32:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.84,0:32:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你欠我的债 都还给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He paid the balance of your debt to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.94,0:32:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此来交换你的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for me arranging your death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.94,0:32:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你的坦白 Ovidius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for your honesty, ovidius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.57,0:32:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀了我的 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to kill me, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.90,0:32:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的奴隶会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My slave is going to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.14,0:33:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这该死的地方烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn this fucking place to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是首先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.54,0:33:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.94,0:33:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.47,0:33:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不配呆在这围墙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not honor these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是众所周知的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fact well known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.07,0:33:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说也是这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it always been so for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你第一次被带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were brought here for the first time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.67,0:33:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非自愿的时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against your will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.10,0:33:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命就值几个钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life traded for a few coins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.84,0:33:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.80,0:33:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的价值？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your worth, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.97,0:33:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it ever occurred to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.97,0:33:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么伟大的Theokoles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the great theokoles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.40,0:34:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的出现 会让我们荣耀万分？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would grace us with his presence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对财富的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}A promise of wealth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.27,0:34:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之影已经赚了很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shadow has earned a thousand fortunes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来此不是为了财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes here not for coin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.47,0:34:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是为了荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes here for the glory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.44,0:34:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和卡普亚战神角斗的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of facing the champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.07,0:34:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可战胜的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The undefeated gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.90,0:34:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.07,0:34:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no greater thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.27,0:34:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,比胜利地站在竞技场上 更让人骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than standing victorious arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.10,0:34:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了血的较量 就没有其他目标吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no purpose beyond the blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.70,0:34:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了胜利的欢呼 就没有梦想了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No dream beyond the cheering crowd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.14,0:34:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有值得你为之战斗的事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there nothing else you fight for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.07,0:34:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 女主人召见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, you are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进光里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step into the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.00,0:35:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我仔细看看我们的卡普亚战神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me gaze upon the champion of capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.80,0:35:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are truly a wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.61,0:35:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are you, domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.37,0:35:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有多少时间了 要好好利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time and I would see it well used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有触发你的激情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I not stir you to passion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.51,0:35:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.57,0:35:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命根不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cock would disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.74,0:35:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我的心不在焉 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse my distraction domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.04,0:35:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想明天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have thoughts of tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.27,0:36:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你只想着 深深植入我身体的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you in the moment, deep inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.14,0:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没面对过 像Theokoles这样的对手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never faced an opponent like theokoles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.84,0:36:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没遇见过 像你一样的男人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has never meet a man like you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.90,0:36:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求你 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg a favor domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.34,0:36:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情会让一个男人在上战场前变得脆弱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love makes a man weak before battle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.17,0:36:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你变强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.87,0:36:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们舍弃一个晚上的欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will forgo the pleasures of a single evening, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来祈求上天 赐予我们更长久的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray to the gods for many more to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.51,0:37:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.30,0:37:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天会死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to die tomorrow aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.84,0:37:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有天知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the gods divine the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.94,0:37:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让Ilithyia帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you let ilithyia help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以和她父亲说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could have spoken to her father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.94,0:37:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,换回耻辱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humiliation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.14,0:37:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬和荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor and glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你唯一在意的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you care about, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.54,0:38:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是这么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still the fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.27,0:38:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过爱会让男人颓丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said love drains a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.94,0:38:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果爱对了人的话 爱能给他希望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can give him hope, in the right arms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.34,0:38:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的胜率不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds do not favor you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.77,0:39:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seldom do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说Barca在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard barca has laid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.90,0:39:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,下了重注\N{\fnArial\fs30}A large amount of coin on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.90,0:39:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人下在Crixus身上 但还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}More towards crixus, but still…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.70,0:39:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.27,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有钱的话 我会跟着Barca全下掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had the means, I would wager all with barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.07,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命太硬 死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too fucking stubborn to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.70,0:39:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man has his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷天神 让你多活几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray to the gods you have not yet reached yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they do not answer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.37,0:39:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要请你帮我一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would ask a thing of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.34,0:39:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽全力去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do everything I can to find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.10,0:39:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.04,0:39:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你将面对一个传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you face a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.37,0:40:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你也会成为传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may yet become one yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.80,0:40:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Septimus赢了 我说得没错吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Septimus the victor, as I said!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valarius在进攻的时候 总是忘记拿好盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valarius always drops his shield when he attacks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.90,0:40:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果矛一戳 就玩儿完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A disadvantage against the spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.54,0:40:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子观察力真敏锐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has a keen eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.07,0:40:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈到角斗士 那倒的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards gladiators, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是谈到学习 那又是另一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His studies are another matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.27,0:40:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名望 已经是历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hour of glory is long past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.97,0:40:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的名望 有待自己去争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours stands before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.61,0:40:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁热打铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heel old wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:40:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了那个野种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill that fucking son of a whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.74,0:41:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算到终极勇士的时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, the primus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.94,0:41:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种时刻 总让我口干舌燥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another moment and my tongue would turn to dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.70,0:41:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.24,0:41:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.44,0:41:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've used our last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 用点我带来的水吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Share some of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.80,0:41:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑得真周到 Solonius\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too kind, good solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.17,0:41:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是可以的话 你也会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd do the same, if you were able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.74,0:41:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.17,0:41:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles很快会以血祭天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon theokoles will honor the gods with blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 天神就会赐予我们倾盆大雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turn will bless us with endless rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.74,0:41:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray for the truth in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.57,0:41:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干旱让城市濒临崩溃了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This drought is driving the city mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.17,0:41:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到个噩耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunate word has reached us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.70,0:41:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最爱的侄子Ovidius 在家里遇害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That our dearest cousin ovidius was murdered in his home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.14,0:41:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.14,0:41:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前 我才谈起过他太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mentioned his wife not a night ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.47,0:41:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他儿子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of his son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.70,0:41:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才那么小\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.37,0:42:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的房子烧光了 只找到几具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their villa was burnt, only a few bodies yet recovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.40,0:42:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕那孩子也难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the boy is among the ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.87,0:42:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是谁如此心狠手辣 真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cannot but wonder what would prompt such an act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.44,0:42:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们继续诚心祈雨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us turn our minds to thoughts of rain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.10,0:42:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,以解城市酷热的燃眉之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cool the fevered brow of our city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.70,0:42:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚的市民们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens of capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.67,0:42:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马的兄弟姐妹们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers of rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.40,0:42:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我祖先之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the name of my forefathers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.61,0:42:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 Titus Calavius 现在向你们呈献\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, titus calavius, present to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,终极对决！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final event!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.67,0:42:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女人 是不是… 血和死亡的壮景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your woman, is she the reason a spectacle of blood and death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.30,0:42:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活下去的理由？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You refuse to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.04,0:42:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给谷神的祭品 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacrifice to ceres, she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.61,0:42:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给我们最伟大的复兴女神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great goddess of renewal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.34,0:42:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 或许有些东西能胜过荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps there is something beyond glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.64,0:42:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐给我们倾盆大雨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shower us with an ocean of rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.54,0:42:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quintus Lentulus Batiatus家族的勇士上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the house of quintus lentulus batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.04,0:43:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 斯巴达克斯！色雷斯角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, spartacus! Thraex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.87,0:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天参赛的还有 不可战胜的高卢人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joined in battle today by the undefeated gaul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.37,0:43:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champion of capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.87,0:43:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请 Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.51,0:43:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢角斗士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murmillo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.54,0:43:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.80,0:43:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.10,0:43:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.54,0:43:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以开始了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.44,0:43:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们决斗的是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together they stand against a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.44,0:44:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,屡战屡胜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has never fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.24,0:44:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头野性十足的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beast that has never been tamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.00,0:44:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个光彩熠熠的传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A legend that has never been tarnished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.40,0:44:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,由Marcus Decius Solonius选派\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the grace of marcus decius solonius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.54,0:44:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请！Theokoles！死亡之影！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold! Theokoles! The shadow of death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.47,0:45:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.90,0:45:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.64,0:45:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们砍到他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They draw blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.40,0:46:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.84,0:46:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.57,0:47:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁 卡普亚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.57,0:48:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普亚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.00,0:48:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以开始了吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I begin?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.20,0:48:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 否则我杀了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give ground, or I'll kill you myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.34,0:50:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theokoles啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theokoles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.47,0:51:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀！杀！杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅呆了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spar-ta-cus!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.10,0:53:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spar-ta-cus!!{\r}
